# final-combined Gate 1: chase R/sE/sT/sL toward 1.
# Gate 0 base (2048 / 0.95 / APC on / uncapped) kept. Binding miss is p95 TPOT
# 82–90ms at peak ~111. Official vLLM lever for decode latency without MTP weights:
# n-gram speculative decoding (docs.vllm.ai speculative_decoding / n_gram).
# MTP + explicit APC is still forbidden (measured ~1% hits, S=0).
CMKL/MANGO1.5-Qwen3.5-9B-AWQ-W4A16-mtp
--host 0.0.0.0
--port 8000
--served-model-name mango1.5-awq-w4a16
--trust-remote-code
--gpu-memory-utilization 0.95
--max-model-len 40960
--enable-auto-tool-choice
--tool-call-parser qwen3_coder
